{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1214917-millenium-falcon-size","id":1214917,"title":"Millenium Falcon Size","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-03T22:25:36-07:00","id":1214917,"title":"Millenium Falcon Size","content":"For Chronicle-specific reasons, it's become desirable to know the Size rating of the Millennium Falcon. It's apparently just under 35m long, which I'll call 33m for a specific reason, which makes it 22m wide and 8m tall, which is slightly longer and taller, and very much wider, than a blue whale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1184,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","user":"LadyLens","date":". 05-04-2018, 02:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T22:37:13-07:00","id":1214921,"title":"","content":"CofD core book puts a Small House at 30, while a Large House is 40.<br /> I wouldn't quite put it within either category, so I'd say Size 35.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T22:43:36-07:00","id":1214922,"title":"","content":"All we have on the topic <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/345029-matter-of-size\">how to judge Size in CoD games</a>. The <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/345029-matter-of-size?p=347750#post347750\">closest we have to some hard Size answers on particular dimensions putted</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-04-2018, 01:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T07:10:09-07:00","id":1215027,"title":"","content":"Looking at <a href=\"http://www.readersadvice.com/museum/mfextra.html\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>, shouldn't be more than Size 6 or 7. <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23771-acediamond","name":"aceDiamond","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23771_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T07:32:57-07:00","id":1215039,"title":"","content":"Id say ~30-40 in size. But more importantly, how did this become &quot;desirable to know&quot; ? I need answers?! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/523-poseur","name":"Poseur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"375"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T11:11:47-07:00","id":1215158,"title":"","content":"Kind of a long story. Short version: In a mixed campaign, a changeling motley used a custom Contract (created in-game, and it took a lot of work) to bring the Falcon into reality. Now I want to give it some magical enhancements, so I need to know its Size.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T11:21:31-07:00","id":1215165,"title":"","content":"How broken is the Masquerade currently? Still possible to fix with some superglue and good crafts? Or ground to dust and then spread across the ocean?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T11:41:15-07:00","id":1215177,"title":"","content":"Well, the Falcon was brought into a hangar on a little-used airport, a hangar owned by one of the Freehold's monarchs. So far, it hasn't actually been seen by regular people, and we're trying to decide what to do with it. Obviously just flying it around is currently considered a poor choice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T12:31:53-07:00","id":1215199,"title":"","content":"How do you run the Skies of the Hedge? Thorns all the way? Completely clear? Thorns as impossible wind currents that tear you in all sorts of directions at once if you stray out of the safe flight pattern?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T12:46:49-07:00","id":1215207,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://wodan.obsidianportal.com/wiki_pages/size\" target=\"_blank\">This</a> is probably the most useful size chart I have seen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":414,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","user":"Gallus","date":". 05-04-2018, 03:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T22:48:24-07:00","id":1215375,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1214917-millenium-falcon-size?p=1215199#post1215199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How do you run the Skies of the Hedge? Thorns all the way? Completely clear? Thorns as impossible wind currents that tear you in all sorts of directions at once if you stray out of the safe flight pattern?</div> </div> </div> </div>The question hasn't come up yet. We &quot;stole&quot; the Falcon from Docking Bay 97 and flew it out of the wall we were using for a movie screen. The Glamour cost was horrendous, but not Size-based. To take an object out of a film with the Contract costs an amount of Glamour equal to the object's cost as a Merit (along with a very difficult Wyrd-based extended action). The Falcon, we agreed, counted as several Merits, and we'd have to spend XPs to actually buy the Merits in order to make the Falcon genuinely ours (otherwise it would just fade back into the Skein at the end of the chapter). Fortunately, all of us are of the &quot;save 'em up'&quot; school of experience point usage, so on the rare occasions a large expenditure becomes desirable, like a Bastion for the changelings or in this case the Falcon, we can cover the cost. In game, we're claiming it by doing things like giving it a thorough cleaning, taking turns sleeping aboard, and installing a proper galley.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1184,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","user":"LadyLens","date":". 05-05-2018, 01:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}